{"file": "我李长生重回八零，赶山狩猎养妻女-第163集.mp4", "ep": 163, "duration": 61.3, "segments": [{"start": 0.98, "end": 2.58, "text": "这花花绿绿的傻票"}, {"start": 2.58, "end": 3.42, "text": "外汇券"}, {"start": 3.42, "end": 6.46, "text": "有一商店买金口屋"}, {"start": 6.46, "end": 7.7, "text": "你大连额还好使"}, {"start": 7.7, "end": 9.5, "text": "这帮熏子连跑路前都备好了"}, {"start": 9.5, "end": 10.5, "text": "可惜"}, {"start": 10.5, "end": 12.18, "text": "陆飞现在归咱了"}, {"start": 12.18, "end": 13.18, "text": "李长生"}, {"start": 13.18, "end": 14.18, "text": "够狠"}, {"start": 14.18, "end": 15.18, "text": "哥"}, {"start": 15.18, "end": 17.63, "text": "这趟可真没白来"}, {"start": 17.63, "end": 20.78, "text": "走 回家过年"}, {"start": 20.78, "end": 21.78, "text": "我的老天爷"}, {"start": 21.78, "end": 23.01, "text": "这是黑虾子"}, {"start": 23.01, "end": 24.01, "text": "这么大个"}, {"start": 24.01, "end": 26.29, "text": "少说六百斤吧"}, {"start": 26.29, "end": 27.29, "text": "长生"}, {"start": 27.29, "end": 28.29, "text": "你这是把山神爷"}, {"start": 28.29, "end": 29.29, "text": "做齐给结回来了"}, {"start": 29.29, "end": 30.29, "text": "好小子"}, {"start": 30.29, "end": 31.29, "text": "脱五进山"}, {"start": 31.29, "end": 32.29, "text": "全存就你敢"}, {"start": 32.29, "end": 33.29, "text": "这手艺"}, {"start": 33.29, "end": 34.29, "text": "十里八乡找不到的"}, {"start": 34.29, "end": 35.8, "text": "大爷"}, {"start": 35.8, "end": 36.8, "text": "您再瞅瞅这个"}, {"start": 36.8, "end": 37.8, "text": "阳枪"}, {"start": 37.8, "end": 39.8, "text": "比咱大队那几条老家伙强多了"}, {"start": 39.8, "end": 40.83, "text": "长生哥说了"}, {"start": 40.83, "end": 41.83, "text": "留给安保队"}, {"start": 41.83, "end": 42.83, "text": "以后谁敢往后山撒野"}, {"start": 42.83, "end": 43.83, "text": "先问问这跟阳铁管子"}, {"start": 43.83, "end": 44.83, "text": "大不答应"}, {"start": 44.83, "end": 45.83, "text": "好"}, {"start": 45.83, "end": 46.83, "text": "好"}, {"start": 46.83, "end": 47.83, "text": "长生"}, {"start": 47.83, "end": 48.83, "text": "你是真给咱靠山腿"}, {"start": 48.83, "end": 49.83, "text": "长脸了"}, {"start": 49.83, "end": 50.83, "text": "叔 叫人卸肉"}, {"start": 50.83, "end": 51.83, "text": "熊皮我留着"}, {"start": 51.83, "end": 52.83, "text": "肉全存分"}, {"start": 52.83, "end": 53.83, "text": "都听见没有"}, {"start": 53.83, "end": 54.83, "text": "回家拿盘去"}, {"start": 54.83, "end": 55.83, "text": "好"}]}